"""lntrn-typing-view — monkeytype-style TUI typing test.

Monkeytype-style typing test with the amber lantern aesthetic: pick
difficulty / length / mode, type over greyed-out text, get the full stats
breakdown (net + raw wpm, accuracy, consistency, wpm-over-time graph).
History and personal bests live at $XDG_DATA_HOME/lntrn/typing_history.json.
stdlib only, no external deps. Launched by `lntrn --typing`.
"""
